  "description": "The Quick RIME AERO is a race-oriented carbon road bike that brings Quick Pro aerodynamic technology to a more accessible price point. Its streamlined frame profile helps reduce drag and maintain momentum at speed, while aggressive race geometry delivers responsive handling and efficient power transfer for fast group rides, sprints, and competitive efforts. Built with a T700/T800 + M46 carbon layup—distinct from the Blade and ER:ONE platforms—the RIME AERO balances performance, durability, and value for riders pursuing race-ready capability on a realistic budget. Hydraulic disc brakes provide confident, consistent stopping power in changing conditions, and the performance-focused drivetrain supports smooth, reliable power delivery. To maintain its competitive price, the RIME AERO is offered in fixed paint finishes with a defined handlebar configuration rather than custom paint or cockpit options.",
